# Import and document safety

Keep original bytes, hash, parser/mapping version, preview and commit result.
Validate server-side again before commit. Import commits must be tenant-safe,
atomic and idempotent; failure must not leave hidden partial bookkeeping.
Never overwrite original documents. Derived OCR, previews and normalized files
are separate versions.
